{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】港鐵天水圍站故障的工程車已駛離行車綫，屯馬綫列車服務逐步回復正常。</p>\n<p>早上近六時，港鐵天水圍站有工程車設備故障，屯馬綫候車時間一度較平日多10至15分鐘。工程人員約二十多分鐘後將工程車移離行車綫，列車服務逐步回復正常。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T23:17:07.531583+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T23:03:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T23:10:36.004823+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T23:10:36.004823+00:00","content_hash":"b2603106feee8eed44347e00f058aa574256d1aecf9daa6bb134bc9c79963d45","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}